  "title": "Personalized Christian Affirmation Butterflies Th - Christian Blankets",
  "handle": "personalized-christian-affirmation-butterflies-th-christian-blankets",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we believe in creating gifts that speak from the heart. This personalized blanket combines faith, love, and comfort, making it an ideal keepsake or thoughtful gift for Christian women. Featuring inspirational Christian designs and the option for custom text, this throw blanket offers daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique &amp; Personalized Gift:</strong> A perfect custom gift that combines faith, love, and comfort, designed to be a cherished keepsake for Christian women.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Customization:</strong> Personalize your blanket by selecting a design and adding a custom name or text to create a unique and meaningful item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Four Size Options:</strong> Available in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit various preferences and uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Christian Design:</strong> Features uplifting faith-based messages and Christian themes, providing daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile for Any Occasion:</strong> An ideal gift for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or other special milestones, offering spiritual encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Lightweight:</strong> Made with polyester fabric and fill, this lightweight throw blanket is comfortable for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Maintain the blanket's quality with simple hand washing instructions.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
